{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791541860, "covers_from": "2026-10-09T10:31:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-09T10:32:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791541920, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-09T10:31:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 56999, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "目前都更速度慢有一個原因是地段。非馬路邊的地段很多建商都不願意承接。只能讓老公寓越來越不安全。", "display_name": "士林代表 吳政翰", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-09T10:31:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 53986, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北人行空間都被停摩托車佔滿，行人、小孩必需走在車道與汽機車共用，太不人道、不安全、不文明！請問市長", "display_name": "信義代表 No.53,986", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-09T10:31:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 35357, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "大安區永康街、大安公園等地，很多觀光客，看他們找不到丟垃圾的地方，實在不便，請首善之都大方一點改善。", "display_name": "大安代表 No.35,357", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-09T10:31:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 30055, "sprite_key": "elephant_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "其他", "content": "我希望未來能讓在台北沒有房子的人也能有管道入籍台北，不用麻煩別人，我在台北生活二十年了，我喜歡台北～", "display_name": "士林代表 士", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 53986, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.53,986", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 35357, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.35,357", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 30055, "sprite_key": "elephant_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 士", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 44693, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "